WEBVTT

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.670
Hey, do you hear me?

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.420
You don't have to force yourself.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:24.330
If this is too painful for you,
you can just leave everything and run!

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.790
It's your life after all.
You can do what you want!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.330
Yes.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.790
I can't believe that

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.420
I'm here again.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.250
Come in.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.120
Here they are.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.250
Demon Queen Echidna.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.540
The Elite Four.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.290
It will be fine.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:11.920
They don't know my true identity yet.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.380
Not yet.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.330
I have to get closer.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.500
Closer.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.500
I'm the former hero, Leo Demonhart!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.330
I'm here for the recruitment interview
to join the demon army!

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.210
I'm excellent at swordsmanship,
black magic, holy magic

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.500
and many other skills.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.620
I have the achievement of defeating
Demon Queen Echidna in a one-on-one battle.

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:55.830
I can be a useful force in the army immediately.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.500
I know the present situation in the demon army.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.500
The army is having a hard time

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.670
due to a lack of soldiers, isn't it?

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:04.920
After all, I was the one

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.290
who made you suffer these.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.330
But let's forget about the past!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.540
We should focus on the future now.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.210
It is time to welcome a hopeful tomorrow.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.710
To eliminate the foolish humans

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.000
and build a demon kingdom
that lasts for a millennium.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.210
I wish to join the new demon army!

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:40.460
I'm certain...

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.620
I will definitely get accepted.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:46.710
Of course you won't get accepted, you fool!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.670
If you take me in,

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.540
you will have great support.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.880
I will make you the strongest demon queen.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.380
Shut it!

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.710
Of course, your army will also grow rapidly.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.000
Enough!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.710
Performance increase, overwhelming growth.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:08.790
Just die!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.670
Whether it's making tea or coffee,

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.380
cleaning the toilet,

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:14.170
Such a bargain...

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.380
Also,

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.580
- Well, I'll tell you my story now.
- it's limited...

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.790
It was a year ago.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.830
The demon army led by Echidna

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:26.000
attacked the human world from the demon world.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:30.460
I was ordered by the king
to take down the demon army.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:34.380
I departed from the holy city
with elites from different cities.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.330
I'm not trying to brag but...

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.920
I am strong.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.790
With the title of the Kingdom's Knight,

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.540
I've mastered all kinds of weapons.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.960
I'm also a top magician.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:49.750
To be honest, friends only get in my way.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.710
Priest that knew nothing
but healing magic.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.830
Swordsman that couldn't use magic at all.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.540
And archer that was basically useless
in close combat.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.330
Building trusting relationships
with these burdens

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:04.330
and defeating the enemies
with the power of friendship.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:07.710
Every time we arrived in a different city,
we quarreled over the allocation of the rooms.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.000
How troublesome!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.460
While we were doing that,

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.960
I could have rescued the
world five times on my own!

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:13.830
(THE RULES OF SCORING AN INTERVIEW)

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.540
In the end, I traveled alone,

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.080
defeated Echidna

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.120
and wiped out the demon army all by myself.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.080
I'm such a strong hero.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.710
Why are you not accepting me?

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:29.210
Leo, you are rejected
probably because of your personality.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.380
I'm a changed man now.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:34.710
Yes, you're a changed man now.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.250
Lili, you're noisy. Stop jumping around.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.000
Let's just let him in.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.830
I think it's fine, Mernes.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.920
Lili is also happy about the
reunion after this long, right?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.250
Now that I have a good look,

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.750
you guys are pretty diverse.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.250
Just tell us what you want to say.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.290
If Lady Echidna found out that we are here,

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:04.830
she will definitely burn this castle down.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.960
We made it very clear
that you won't get accepted.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.790
But we were forced to give you a chance
because of what you did.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:15.170
You're right.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:18.380
I'll do a presentation.

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:19.670
Presentation?

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:24.790
Yes, I want all of you to
know again how strong I am.

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:26.670
What do you mean?

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:30.170
I admit that I have a troublesome personality.

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:32.960
But I am strong enough
to defeat the Elite Four alone.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:36.330
That should make up for my shortcoming.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.920
I would like to remind how you were defeated

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.670
to increase my chance of being accepted.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:41.790
What?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:44.790
I see.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.880
Leo, you are indeed strong.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.540
It's been long since

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.580
I last lost a head-to-head battle.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.620
That is not a laughing matter.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:55.960
No.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:59.620
Being able to fight a strong opponent
is something to be happy for.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.420
Right, Leo?

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:05.580
He was the first
out of the Elite Four to fight me.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.830
The swordsman with the name of "The Red Roar",

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.210
Dragon General, Edvard.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.250
Judging solely from his physique,

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.750
he should be the strongest.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.290
As one of the dragon men,
he has dragon scales on his body.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:30.750
It was really hard.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.250
If I only fought with a sword,
I don't know how it would end up.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:40.120
He is an idiot who likes frontal battles.

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:42.580
If he isn't the type to fight fair and square,

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.580
I would have a hard time fighting him.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.580
It's good!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.620
By the way,

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.080
why are you following Echidna?

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.540
I'm sure you want to be
the ruler of the world too.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.290
Well,

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:03.250
I've never thought about it.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.380
Fighting strong opponents

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:09.580
as a swordsman probably suits me better.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.710
Besides,

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.380
being a king is really busy.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.420
I would hate it if I don't get enough
talk with my daughter, Julietta.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.710
That would be so painful.
I can't bear it at all.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.250
A daughter.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.460
He's pathetic when it comes to that.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.540
How is that pathetic?

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.710
Traveling alone means that

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:34.920
you don't have any friends to spend time with.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:38.460
You're the only one who I don't
want to hear that from, Mernes.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.210
You probably don't have any friends yourself.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:44.670
He was the next to fight me after Edvard.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:49.710
"The Invisible Blade"
Shadowless General, Mernes.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:56.080
As a half-human and a half-demon,
he was the genius raised by the assassin guild.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:00.250
In fact, his ability to erase his presence
and his agility were impressive.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.920
I might have lost
if it went on for another five minutes.

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:07.000
But I didn't plan to defeat him
using speed in the first place.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:14.120
I focused on defending and casting
the forbidden spell, Crimson Comet.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.920
Finally I managed to destroy the guild
and defeat Mernes.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.330
If I had to say,

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.960
what came afterward was far more troublesome.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.880
The damage caused by
the forbidden spell was too strong.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:27.250
Even the cultural heritage
of that town was destroyed.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:32.620
What happened after the dispute
with the citizens?

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:35.210
Didn't they ask for compensation...

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:42.920
- I can hear nothing. Nothing at all.
- I can hear nothing. Nothing at all.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.210
Lili, come on.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:47.080
Leo, how was my impersonation just now?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.330
Was it similar?

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.080
After Mernes,

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.460
it was her next.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:57.580
"The Ruthless Fang"
Beast General, Lili.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:00.080
Our encounter was really stupid.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.880
When I was hiding from the rain under a tree,

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:06.580
a girl stood next to me all of a sudden.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.420
She looked as if she lost her memory.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.290
What I knew was that
she had no parents or friends.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.000
And she had nowhere to go.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.500
I couldn't just leave a kid alone.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.580
A few days after I settled her down

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:24.880
and she recovered her memories,
I found out that she is the Beast General, Lili.

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:28.580
Since she is one of the Elite Four,

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.540
I just have to defeat her without holding back.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.250
So I did.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.620
I defeat her unfortunately.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:36.210
It was then I realized that

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.500
for her race,

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.960
to be defeated by
the opposite gender who is strong

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.330
means a fated encounter with their partner.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.580
Why did I get involved with her?

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.540
Hey, let's get married.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.500
All right? Let's get married!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.330
Well, after you've grown up.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:01.000
No, I want to get married now! Now!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.040
Come on.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:06.380
The last opponent was The Almighty Magic.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:08.460
The Sorcerer General, Dianette.

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:12.040
She has a much greater magical power
than the others.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:17.080
Apparently, she has mastered every spell
including the ancient and the forbidden ones.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.120
Therefore, I used an ancient spell

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:23.580
effective on both sides to seal off all magic.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:26.210
To force her into real combat.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:33.460
She turned out to be really weak.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.170
She soon cried after hitting
me for two minutes.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.420
How pitiful.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.620
I am a magician!

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:45.920
How am I supposed to win a hero with strength?

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:48.380
A professional should have
thought of another way.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:52.750
All my defense spells were
ignored from the beginning.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.210
Nobody in the world

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.670
would seal off all magic!

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.420
There is. I am one.

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.710
By the way, what are we doing here?

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:07.040
Didn't I say I was doing a presentation?

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:10.210
I was also curious how the rest were defeated.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.420
We were suddenly defeated when we realized.

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.120
That's right.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.880
I wanted to know too.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:19.210
But Shutina, that was really embarrassing.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.040
Yes.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.460
It's pitiful.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.920
Enough! Just cut to the chase!

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.170
As a hero,

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:35.380
why did you come for the interview?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.500
This is what I wanted to ask.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:42.670
Why do you want to join the demon army?

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.830
Of course, I'm not here to fool around.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.290
Well,

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.290
I challenged the demon army by myself.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:01.080
Why am I joining the enemy's side?

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.620
The reason was that...

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.830
After defeating you guys

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:04.540
and won in the battle against Echidna,

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.000
I went back to the holy city, Renaie.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:19.500
But I got neither the cheering from the citizens

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.170
nor the huge rewards from the king.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.580
- I was received with hostility, fear
- It's the hero.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:27.670
- and doubtful looks.
- Did he really defeat the demon army?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.880
- That was all.
- He came out uninjured. Is he really human?

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.460
- He is a monster disguised as a human!
- Who can stop him if he attacks us?

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.580
It will be the end of us if that happens.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.420
This is bad!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:36.920
Once the fire is lit,

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.960
nobody could stop people
from feeling fear or anxiety.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.420
Mails, letters, Sending spells, posters.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:50.170
The rumor that Hero Leo is dangerous
spread throughout the city in a short time.

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:54.000
We have no choice but to exile him!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.920
Before he tries anything to harm us,

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.000
we have to kill the hero...

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.210
No, we have to kill the monster!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.830
That's right. Kill him!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.420
I will be the next Demon King.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.670
Most of the people believed in that.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:16.620
Assassins who tried to kill me kept coming up.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:18.920
Even stupidity has its limit.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:21.880
I defeated the Demon Queen by myself.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:25.040
How would I lose to a bunch of assassins?

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:29.790
One day, I was finally summoned by the king.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:33.880
It's true that we managed to protect
the Stone of the Philosopher.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:36.170
because of what you did.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.080
It pains me too.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:44.170
But as the king, I can't ignore
the voices of my people.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.000
Hero Leo.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:50.500
As the king, I order you to leave this country.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:15:59.960
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.500
Don't forget.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.170
I believe in you.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:15.710
Why did I

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:19.880
risk my life to protect this world?

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.420
Why did I

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:24.420
fought with the Demon King's Army?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:27.000
It all seemed unimportant.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.250
I was initially a wanderer

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.250
who does not belong anywhere.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.540
I wandered between
different cities without target.

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.250
Until one day...

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:42.330
Do you know the rumors about the demon army?

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.580
You mean the recruitment?

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:45.500
Is that true?

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.880
Apparently, they are trying to rebuild the army.

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.750
They were utterly defeated by the hero, huh?

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:51.960
They just never learn their lesson.

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.750
That Demon Queen Echidna.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:54.880
Is she an idiot?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.830
Echidna...

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.250
That's right.

00:16:57.250 --> 00:17:00.620
She's going to disappear anyway.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.830
Yes.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.330
So it's Echidna.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.040
By the way, how is that thing going on?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.250
Somehow,

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.750
at that moment,

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.040
the Demon Army is the only place

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:15.500
that will accept me.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.210
That was what I thought.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:22.580
I spent all night thinking about
how I should introduce myself.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.330
I prepared the presentation material,

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.580
walked past the endless desert

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.080
and went over dangerous mountains

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.500
to come to this place.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.960
If the world wants to kill me...

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.960
Then I'll kill the world instead.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:43.170
These are the reason I wanted to join.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.120
Fine, Hero Leo.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:03.120
A pitiful hero who obeyed and protected
the wrong people.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.920
I will believe that

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.040
your motive is sincere.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:11.170
Thank you, Sorcerer General Shutina.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.290
Finally I went over it.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:20.750
However,

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.710
you will have a month of probation period.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:25.710
I will be your supervisor

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.920
and check how you work.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:31.670
You'll have to bring us some results
within the probation period.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.960
If I failed to do so?

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.170
I will kick you out.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.710
I will do my best to work.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.330
I don't want to go back to
living on the streets.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:44.960
Also, Lady Echidna must not know that
you joined the demon army.

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:46.620
To keep it a secret,

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:50.540
please use magic or any tools
to hide your identity.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:51.710
I got it.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.620
What are the issues you are facing now?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.920
First, it's strengthening military power,
fixing the castle and purchasing weaponry.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:02.080
Then, it's reducing cost, enhancing
welfare, and setting consultation sessions.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:05.710
Also maintaining the magical furnace
and educating the new soldiers.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.000
Rebuilding the army is seriously hard.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.710
Not just Shutina.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.830
I'm having a hard time as well.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.620
Lili, stop jumping around.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.460
Recently, I've been assigned with logistics...?

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:22.750
It's like replenishing supplies or something...

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.210
It's really hard.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:26.710
There's so much I have to do!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.960
What? Seriously?

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.790
Hey, isn't logistic

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:35.170
the most important?

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.500
Yes, it's the most important.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:38.920
It was assigned to me.

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:41.120
I'm amazing, aren't I?

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.250
No, this is worse than I imagined.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.290
That was close!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.080
It is all your fault!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.290
All right. Calm down, Shutina.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.580
Since Leo has decided to join us,

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.540
there's nothing more reassuring than that.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.620
You're right, but...

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:02.000
All right.

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:05.250
I will calm down. I will try to calm down.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.120
All right.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.790
Let's forget our past grudges.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:12.330
I'll be counting on you, Leo.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.670
I'll be in your care.

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.880
Yes, I'll be in your care too, Edvard.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.040
Lili, too.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.290
Mernes, are you okay?

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.830
I'll be in your care.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.170
Hero Leo.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:29.540
If you can produce some results
during this probation period,

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.420
I won't say petty words
like accepting you for the time being.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.080
The Elite Four will suggest Lady Echidna

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.830
to officially accept you.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.790
I won't let you guys down.

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:49.460
Solving the issue of being short-handed,

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:52.330
organizing workflow, accumulating technology,

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.120
educating normal soldiers.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.120
There are so many things to do.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:59.040
Rebuilding the army from scratch.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:03.500
It will be harder than walking the path of thorns.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:07.290
That's why I want to ask Echidna.

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:10.790
I've been wanting to ask her since then.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.080
What do you think you're doing?

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.120
Lady Echidna.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.580
I've given my order!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:18.750
Even if it's an invasion,

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.620
I will not allow unnecessary killing!

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:24.960
Invade the land in a way
that brings the least damage.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:27.040
Avoid unnecessary killing.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:32.420
What is the reason to keep fighting even if
that puts her army at disadvantage?

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:34.580
Why

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:38.460
is she not leaving the human world
even being driven like this?

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.620
I would like to talk to you.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:48.120
It's your life after all.
You can do what you want!

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:51.460
Just you watch, Echidna.

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:53.710
I will definitely

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.120
join the demon army.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.420
That was...

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:03.790
(NEXT GIG AT THE DEMON QUEEN'S CASTLE)
my story before joining the demon army.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:09.290
Keep on living,
keep on living with all your might

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:13.500
Light up the future

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:18.750
(I'M QUITTING HEROING)

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:27.460
Staying in the lonely world
where I was betrayed

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:33.830
Afraid of tomorrow, feeling lost

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:36.500
Still searching for somewhere to belong

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:42.380
Screaming internally, wanting to be needed

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.920
The weaving identities

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:51.620
I want to know if could I believe

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:55.080
Keep on living,
keep on living with all your might

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:59.170
Light up the future

00:22:59.170 --> 00:23:02.540
Even if I lose everything

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:06.830
Hope must remain

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:10.620
The meaning of being here

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:14.500
It's okay if to not know it yet

00:23:14.500 --> 00:23:18.250
To smile with you

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:24.040
I will overcome hurdles and march forward

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:40.040
(NEXT EPISODE:
DO WORK THAT MAKES IT EASIER FOR YOU TOMORROW)
